WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.134
The husband of a missing

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.702
mother of three

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.436
searched online

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:06.039
about how to dispose of a 115 pound

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.440
woman's body.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.174
That's according to two

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.442
law enforcement sources

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:10.276
who shared the information

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:11.244
to CNN.

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:11.945
Goodness.

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:12.512
Well, that's

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.314
just one of the disturbing

00:00:14.314 --> 00:00:15.315
new revelations

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:16.282
about the disappearance

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:17.117
of an Walsh

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:17.984
to a picture of her there.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:19.619
Her husband, Brian Walsh,

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:20.820
he has now been charged

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.256
with misleading authorities.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:23.623
CNN's

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:24.691
Jason Carroll is live in

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.359
Cohasset, Massachusetts.

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:28.962
So, Jason, we're also learning

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:30.630
that authorities were searching

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.466
two locations last night.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.534
I wonder,

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:35.502
do we know the significance

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:36.836
of those searches

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:38.405
Well,

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:40.173
they could end up being very,

00:00:40.173 --> 00:00:41.041
very significant.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:41.841
It's still early on

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:42.876
in this investigation.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.644
But as you were saying,

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:45.979
much of that search

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:46.813
and that investigation

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:47.480
shifted here

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.616
from the home in Cohasset

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:50.884
to two facilities,

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.085
one that last night

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:54.521
at a trash facility

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:55.455
in North Boston.

00:00:55.455 --> 00:00:56.723
That's where investigators,

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.625
Jim, spent hours

00:00:58.625 --> 00:00:59.259
combing through

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:00.293
some of the garbage there,

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.628
looking for more evidence

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:02.162
in their case.

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:03.696
In addition to that,

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:04.831
yesterday,

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:05.698
late afternoon

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:06.499
or early evening,

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.535
they also spent some time

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:09.569
sifting through the rubble

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:10.570
at a dumpster

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.806
outside of Walsh's,

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.874
his mother's home,

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:16.443
searching that facility

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:17.477
there as well.

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:18.011
All of this

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:19.646
as a source tells

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:20.880
CNN that investigators

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.381
also found

00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:22.582
very disturbing

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:23.583
Internet searches

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.652
that Walsh had conducted

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:26.886
following his wife's

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:29.089
disappearance, which included

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:32.859
how to dispose of a £115 body

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:34.661
and also how to

00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:36.930
dismember a body and incredibly

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.064
disturbing details

00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:39.032
about this case,

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:41.067
which we also heard yesterday

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:41.968
in court

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.603
during Walsh's arraignment,

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:45.205
where prosecutors

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:46.072
laid out

00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:47.841
what they say investigators

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.008
found at the home

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:51.911
when he's on

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:53.379
surveillance at that time

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:55.648
purchasing about $450

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.250
worth of cleaning supplies.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.251
That would include

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:00.420
mops, bucket tops,

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.590
Twix,

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:05.191
drop cloths,

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:06.092
as well as various

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:07.093
kinds of tape.

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:07.794
Blood was found

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:08.795
in the basement area,

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:09.729
as well as a knife,

00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:11.231
