00:02:26.112 --> 00:02:27.514
this morning, Jim and Erica

00:02:27.514 --> 00:02:28.214
expecting to get

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:29.449
some more information,

00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:31.017
possibly about their case

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:31.851
that should be happening

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:32.886
later today.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:34.053
Again, at this point,

00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:35.855
Walsh has just been charged

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:37.590
