00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:46.866
He told me,

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:47.634
as you can expected,

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:48.801
they are extremely,

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.670
extremely devastated,

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:51.004
he says,

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:52.238
by all of the developments

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:53.640
