00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:54.207
in the news.

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:55.441
He said at this point,

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:56.976
their focus is on

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:58.811
Anna's three small children.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:02:59.445
Joining us now,

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:00.146
Deborah Norville,

00:03:00.146 --> 00:03:01.748
